    narr:narration """The analytics pipeline is undergoing a transition from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB, a move formalized in August 2026. The [migration initiative](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787922122298_1) is driven by expectations of significant technical and economic gains, specifically a projected [10x improvement in query performance](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787922122298_4) alongside reduced licensing costs. While the [operational decision](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787922122298_3) is framed with a focus on future-state performance and efficiency, the [implementation timeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787922122298_5) is set for Q3 2026. The discourse reflects a consensus on the necessity of this shift, balancing the [technical justification](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787922122298_2) provided by internal stakeholders with the formal project requirements outlined by expert oversight.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787922122298_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787922122298_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787922122298_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787922122298_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787922122298_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We're switching from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB for the analytics pipeline." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787922122298_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "10x query performance, lower licensing cost." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787922122298_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Database migration**: PostgreSQL → QuantumDB" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787922122298_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Timeline**: Q3 2026" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787922122298_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The shift is presented as an immediate, active decision by some, while others frame it as a future-oriented project requirement." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787922122298_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787922122298_3> ] ;
